msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:486
msgid "Set Location..."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:487
msgid ""
"<h3>4. Determine connection port</h3>\n"
"\n"
"Enter the port number your telescope is connected to. If you only have one "
"serial port in your computer, the port is usually <tt>/dev/ttyS0</tt> \n"
"<br>"
"<br>If you are unsure about the port number, you can leave the field empty "
"and KStars will try to scan the ports for attached telescopes. Beware that "
"the autoscan process might take few minutes to complete. "
